{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>בוכיה</b> — like \"פוריה\" (its leaf)." "<b>עיני עיני יורדה מים</b> — a person's eye is likened to \"עין המים\" (a spring of water), and the eye flows down, and likewise: \"יזלו מים\". And both are intransitive verbs."], :book :lamentations, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Lamentations -- Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%9E%D7%92%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9B%D7%94"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:27.073528234Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}